  "_meta": {
    "description": "Quality rules text (blob-retirement D-BR2): source itemdescriptor through the charbuild decode_markup (shared glyph-token convention). 30 source-true; the 2 droid variants carry their base quality's text with description_from recorded (adjudicated, never invented). Attachment-MOD descriptors deliberately not carried (no runtime consumer; own scope).",
    "effect_tokens": "A spend row's `effect` is a template the ONE filler (lib/shared/qualityRows.js spendRows) reads: `{field}` prints that `values` field; `{field:noun}` prints the field and its noun, plural when the value is not 1 (`{steps:step}` -> \"1 step\" / \"2 steps\"). Ruled f100-surfacing-hub-concept ADDENDUM 7 (R2; D-215: one token, one filler)."
  }
